  "activityPermissionNoticeBodyMessage": "Partner eggs and today's distance grow with the distance you actually walk. While the app is open it measures distance from your location; walking while the app was closed is filled in from your device's step sensor. Reading that step count needs the 'Physical activity' permission. Continuing will take you to the permission request.",
