  "locationConsentDialogTitle": "Location Data & Age Confirmation",
  "locationConsentBodyMessage": "TourMon uses your location to verify you're near a tourist spot when acquiring an egg, to measure the distance you walk, and to show your current position on the map. All of this happens entirely on your device — your GPS coordinates and route are never sent to or stored on a server. The distance measurement result (an aggregated distance value) is also kept only on your device. You can withdraw this consent anytime by turning off location permission in your device settings, in which case location-based features such as egg acquisition and distance measurement will be unavailable. See the Privacy Policy on the My Page screen for details.",
